{"id":"science-p027","bookId":"science","number":27,"title":"第二章生活常识一、家用电器","width":1190.55,"height":841.89,"image":"data/knowledge/pages/science/science-p027.svg","dataUrl":"data/knowledge/pages/science/science-p027.json","questionCount":27,"version":1,"imagePixels":[2084,1474],"source":{"file":"27上岸村·科技常识思维导图.pdf","sha256":"58396d10bab33da54e68ea993cbfbfe7f67afde003f88d5013e92dcfe8fa27d8","page":27},"nodes":[{"id":"science-p027-n0001","text":"第二章","bbox":[109.724,457.598,46.366,15.455],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.455,"block":0,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0002","text":"生活常识","bbox":[159.953,457.598,61.821,15.455],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.455,"block":0,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0003","text":"一、家用电器","bbox":[273.292,458.25,82.428,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":0,"line":1,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0004","text":"冰箱","bbox":[416.968,168.25,27.476,13.738],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":13.738,"block":1,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0005","text":"工作原理","bbox":[477.072,89.257,54.952,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":2,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0006","text":"冰箱通过","bbox":[564.651,30.012,54.952,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":3,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0007","text":"制冷剂","bbox":[619.603,30.012,41.214,13.738],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":13.738,"block":3,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0008","text":"在系统内循环，利用","bbox":[660.817,30.012,123.642,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":3,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0009","text":"压缩机","bbox":[784.459,30.012,41.214,13.738],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":13.738,"block":3,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0010","text":"做功，使制冷剂在","bbox":[825.673,30.012,109.904,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":3,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0011","text":"气态","bbox":[935.577,30.012,27.476,13.738],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":13.738,"block":3,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0012","text":"和","bbox":[963.053,30.012,13.738,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":3,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0013","text":"液态","bbox":[976.791,30.012,27.476,13.738],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":13.738,"block":3,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0014","text":"之间转换","bbox":[1004.267,30.012,54.952,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":3,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0015","text":"制冷剂在冰箱内部的蒸发器中","bbox":[564.651,69.508,178.594,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":4,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0016","text":"蒸发","bbox":[743.245,69.508,27.476,13.738],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":13.738,"block":4,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0017","text":"，吸收箱体内的热量，使内部降温","bbox":[770.721,69.508,206.07,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":4,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0018","text":"制冷剂被压缩后流向冰箱背部或底部的冷凝器，冷凝","bbox":[564.651,109.005,315.974,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":5,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0019","text":"液化","bbox":[880.625,109.005,27.476,13.738],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":13.738,"block":5,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0020","text":"，将热量释放到空气中","bbox":[908.101,109.005,137.38,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":5,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0021","text":"这就是冰箱侧面或背面摸起来发热的原因","bbox":[564.651,148.502,247.284,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":6,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0022","text":"使用要求","bbox":[477.072,247.244,54.952,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":7,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0023","text":"新冰箱到家后要","bbox":[564.651,187.999,96.166,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":8,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0024","text":"尽快撕掉","bbox":[660.817,187.999,54.952,13.738],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":13.738,"block":8,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0025","text":"保护膜，冰箱属于大功率电器，应使用单独的","bbox":[715.769,187.999,274.76,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":8,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0026","text":"专用插座","bbox":[990.529,187.999,54.952,13.738],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":13.738,"block":8,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0027","text":"冰箱冷藏室的最佳温度是","bbox":[564.651,227.495,151.118,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":9,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0028","text":"4","bbox":[715.769,222.353,8.957,13.738],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":13.738,"block":9,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0029","text":"摄氏度","bbox":[724.724,227.495,41.214,13.738],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":13.738,"block":9,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0030","text":"或略低于此温度","bbox":[765.945,227.495,96.166,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":9,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0031","text":"只要食物","bbox":[564.651,266.992,54.952,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":10,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0032","text":"不烫手","bbox":[619.603,266.992,41.214,13.738],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":13.738,"block":10,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0033","text":"，就应该密封放入冰箱，而非等到凉透","bbox":[660.817,266.992,233.546,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":10,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0034","text":"冰箱应保持","bbox":[564.651,306.489,68.69,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":11,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0035","text":"80%","bbox":[636.896,301.346,28.699,13.738],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":13.738,"block":11,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0036","text":"以下","bbox":[665.587,306.489,27.476,13.738],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":13.738,"block":11,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0037","text":"的使用容量，以此保证足够空间使","bbox":[693.069,306.489,206.07,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":11,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0038","text":"冷空气循环制冷","bbox":[899.139,306.489,96.166,13.738],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":13.738,"block":11,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0039","text":"空调","bbox":[416.968,407.377,27.476,13.738],"color":"#ff6f00","fontSize":13.738,"block":12,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0040","text":"工作原理","bbox":[477.072,345.985,54.952,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":13,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0041","text":"空调与冰箱原理类似，也是利用蒸气压缩式制冷循环","bbox":[564.651,345.985,315.974,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":13,"line":1,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0042","text":"使用要求","bbox":[477.072,468.768,54.952,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":14,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0043","text":"空调属于大功率电器，应使用单独的专用插座","bbox":[564.651,389.775,274.76,13.985],"color":"#ff6f00","fontSize":13.738,"block":15,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0044","text":"短时间外出，","bbox":[564.651,429.272,82.428,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":16,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0045","text":"保持空调运行","bbox":[647.079,429.272,82.428,13.738],"color":"#ff6f00","fontSize":13.738,"block":16,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0046","text":"比关闭后再重启更省电","bbox":[729.507,429.272,137.38,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":16,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0047","text":"空调关机后应等待三分钟后再次启动，以保护压缩机","bbox":[564.651,468.768,315.974,13.985],"color":"#ff6f00","fontSize":13.738,"block":17,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0048","text":"空调","bbox":[564.651,508.265,27.476,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":18,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0049","text":"制冷","bbox":[592.127,508.265,27.476,13.738],"color":"#e53935","fontSize":13.738,"block":18,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0050","text":"时，将出风口","bbox":[619.603,508.265,82.428,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":18,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0051","text":"向上吹","bbox":[702.031,508.265,41.214,13.738],"color":"#e53935","fontSize":13.738,"block":18,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0052","text":"，冷气会自然下沉，房间凉得更快且更均匀","bbox":[743.245,508.265,261.022,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":18,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0053","text":"空调","bbox":[564.651,567.51,27.476,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":19,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0054","text":"制热","bbox":[592.127,567.51,27.476,13.738],"color":"#e53935","fontSize":13.738,"block":19,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0055","text":"时，将出风口","bbox":[619.603,567.51,82.428,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":19,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0056","text":"向下吹","bbox":[702.031,567.51,41.214,13.738],"color":"#e53935","fontSize":13.738,"block":19,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0057","text":"先将地板和人体脚部区域加热，然后热空气自然上升","bbox":[775.873,547.762,315.974,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":20,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0058","text":"使整个房间温暖得更快、更舒适","bbox":[775.873,587.259,192.332,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":21,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0059","text":"微波炉","bbox":[416.968,715.623,41.214,13.738],"color":"#1e88e5","fontSize":13.738,"block":22,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0060","text":"工作原理","bbox":[490.81,666.252,54.952,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":23,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0061","text":"微波穿透食物，使食物中的水分子剧烈","bbox":[578.389,626.755,233.546,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":24,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0062","text":"摩擦","bbox":[811.935,626.755,27.476,13.738],"color":"#1e88e5","fontSize":13.738,"block":24,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0063","text":"摩擦产生热量，从而实现从食物内部到外部的同时加热","bbox":[578.389,666.252,329.711,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":25,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0064","text":"其能量转化过程为电能转化为","bbox":[578.389,705.749,178.594,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":26,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0065","text":"电磁能","bbox":[756.983,705.749,41.214,13.738],"color":"#1e88e5","fontSize":13.738,"block":26,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0066","text":"，再将电磁能转化为","bbox":[798.197,705.749,123.642,13.738],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.738,"block":26,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"science-p027-n0067","text":"内能","bbox":[921.839,705.749,27.476,13.738],"color":"#1e88e5","fontSize":13.738,"